  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The past few beta updates and now the official release build has moved the Forced Camera Near Distance option into the Advanced Graphics Settings. This change would be understandable if the toggle saved between sessions, but it still resets itself after every restart, and anyone that wants to use this feature has to root through the entire menu every time they launch the game. \nThe original spot made this much less of a hassle to find and use and I didn't mind it not saving because of it's ease of access, but now it takes having to navigate through multiple menu pages. My suggestion would be to either allow the Dynamic option to be saved, or to place it back where it used to be as the change in location seems like an unnecessary change.",
